OL,3,GNEWSACharge and arrest in Normanton
OL,4,Arape inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne man has been charged and another
OL,7,Farrested as part of an investigation
OL,8,Finto the rape of a woman in Normanton.
OL,10,FThe offence took place at a property on
OL,11,FWakefield Road in the early hours of 1
OL,12,FAugust and the victim is in her 30s,
OL,13,FWest Yorkshire Police said.
OL,15,FMichael Connors, 28, of no fixed abode,
OL,16,Fappeared before magistrates charged
OL,17,Fwith rape on 22 August and will next
OL,18,Fappear at Leeds Crown Court on 21
OL,19,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
