OL,3,GNEWSACharge and arrest in Normanton
OL,4,Arape inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second man, 22, from Bradford, was
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of rape on
OL,8,FThursday and has been remanded in
OL,9,Fcustody, police said.
